  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><p style='box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>The file includes complete election results by voting location, mayoralty candidate names and total votes. Also included are the results from one vote anywhere fully accessible voting location and the advance voting locations.</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>Voting locations change between elections and cannot be compared. Note: There are many locations inside a ward and the electors that live or own property in that ward are free to vote at any one location within the same ward.</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>Note: To avoid Microsoft Excel from auto-formatting some fields, open CSV file in notepad for best results.</p></div><span style='color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span>"
